# A debugging tool rather than something the game hands out: nothing drops it,
# nothing stocks it, and only test mode's seeding puts any in a bag. It is a
# normal item file so it loads, stacks and inspects like any other.
name: "Level-Up"
category: ITEM_CATEGORY_USE
description: "DEBUG ONLY. Advances the player to the next level."
effect: ITEM_EFFECT_LEVEL_UP
